WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.990
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.990
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:29.170
I am Boehmer, a jeweler from Paris.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:35.540
Lady Marie Antoinette, I have requested
this audience to seek your help.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:44.490
This item I have here, was ordered by the late
King Louis XV to give to Madame du Barry.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:48.090
However, as you are aware,
the King suddenly passed away,

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.070
so this item was left without a buyer.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.490
Due to its outrageous price,

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:59.470
no other royal family in Europe can afford it,
even though they would like to.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:03.410
Your Most Fashionable Majesty,
Lady Marie Antoinette, Queen of France!

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:08.380
This necklace cannot be bought
by anyone, but you!

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.350
How much... is it?

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.680
1,600,000 livres.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.780
<i>1,600,000 livres.</i>

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:23.090
<i>It would be the equivalent of roughly
19.2 billion yen in today's money.</i>

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.740
<i>Due to its outrageous price,</i>

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:29.360
<i>Antoinette gently conveyed to the jeweler,
that she had no intention of purchasing it.</i>

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:37.620
<i>However, this necklace would later plunge
Antoinette into an unforeseen crisis.</i>

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:50.920
