00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.670
Your Majesty, the Queen is here to see you.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.550
Oh? I wonder what brings her here?

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:27.040
Why the sudden formalities?
It's very unusual of you.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.060
Your Majesty.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.670
Yes?

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.950
I have come here today,

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:36.610
to complain to Your Majesty, about a vassal
who has audaciously kicked my stomach.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.030
Kicked your stomach?!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.670
How odd that you are so cheerful about it...

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.100
My Queen!

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.500
Could... Could...Could you be...?!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.610
The Queen is pregnant!

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:01.350
Her Majesty is with child!

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.270
episode

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.270
"The Necklace

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.270
Shines Ominously"

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:15.200
It's a boy, André!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.230
An heir is finally born!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.840
<i>With her affair and separation
with Fersen now behind her,</i>

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:28.180
<i>Queen Marie Antoinette gave
birth to the First Princess,</i>

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:33.080
<i>followed by the birth of the Dauphin,
Prince Joseph in 1781 .</i>

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:41.090
Now, Her Majesty has truly become the Mother
of France, in name and reality.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.690
André, let's celebrate and drink!

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.050
Anywhere is fine! Take me some place
where we can drink merrily.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.430
As you wish, Colonel!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.570
<i>The city of Paris was joyous.</i>

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:00.010
<i>Everyone was celebrating Queen Antoinette.</i>

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.450
<i>That is how Oscar thought and felt.</i>

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.620
<i>She savored the joy that welled
from the bottom of her heart.</i>

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.620
<i>However, Oscar had yet to realize,</i>

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.290
<i>that the people were only merry for the moment.</i>

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.890
<i>She had yet to realize their actual feelings,</i>

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:20.800
<i>and their true nature...</i>

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.640
Drink, everyone, while we still can.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:35.180
Soon, we'll have to carry guns instead of beer.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.350
Drink, everyone, while we still can.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:43.280
Bland soup, crushing taxes, all of it...
Drink it all away.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.460
Come find me as soon as Joseph wakes up.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.290
Yes, certainly.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.230
Well then, Marie Thérèse, it's your turn now.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.900
Let's go out to the gardens.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.750
Come, we'll visit the southern flowerbed today.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:05.760
Here.

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:15.480
How much longer until the Queen's appearance?

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.940
Please forgive me.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.420
It's time for your audience.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.400
Please proceed to the audience chamber.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.150
Lord Beaufort, the Queen will see you now!

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:30.930
I am a landowner who possesses property in
the Monpazier area, in Périgord province.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:35.100
Due to heavy rain, the quality of the grape
harvest has been rather mediocre this year,

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:38.770
so collecting taxes from the farmers
has been quite difficult...

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.110
Next please.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:40.540
Yes. Here.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.670
Lord Merobel, the Queen will see you now!

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.170
Baroness Beauvilliers!

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:02.460
You wish to leave the palace
and move to the villa?

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.430
Yes.

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:07.320
If I stay here, I'll be pressed by my duties and
won't have time to play with the children.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.200
That's rather troubling...

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:12.080
You're the only one who can hold
the audiences with the nobles.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.540
Please, Your Majesty.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:19.870
<i>Marie Antoinette moved from the palace to
a small villa on the grounds of Versailles.</i>

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:24.390
<i>Her duties and palace formalities were
nothing but a bothersome burden to her.</i>

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:32.020
<i>Petit Trianon is a small cozy château built
amid the vast gardens of Versailles.</i>

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.310
<i>It was the best environment for the Queen
to blissfully spend time with her children.</i>

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:41.780
<i>Furthermore, access to Trianon was limited
to a few people from her close inner circle.</i>

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:48.540
<i>As a result, official audiences with Queen
Marie Antoinette were no longer held.</i>

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:02.590
Lately, more and more nobles are
speaking ill about Her Majesty.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:07.090
Although they spend 10 or 20 days traveling from distant provinces
for an audience, their access to Trianon is strictly denied.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:13.050
There are even some who  boisterously complain, that the
nobility's long-standing service to the royal household...

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.800
...has been forgotten by the Queen.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.010
Stop, André.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.870
I don't want to hear about such things.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:25.750
<i>Have you seen the way she plays
with her children so innocently?</i>

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.550
<i>It's been so long since I've seen her smile so brightly.</i>

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.950
<i>Isn't her smile alone enough cause for rejoice?</i>

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.660
Austria

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.160
Schönbrunn Palace

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:49.460
Such a fool you are...
My daughter, Antoinette...

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:53.510
You have forgotten your responsibilities
and abandoned your duties as Queen...

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.390
Not only that, you have
withdrawn to a villa...!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.250
Mother!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.020
Mother, are you all right?!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.400
Please hang on, Mother!

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.150
Joseph...

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.650
It's all right...

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.620
Help isn't necessary...

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.000
My daughter...

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.440
Love thy people and be loved as Queen!

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:34.620
<i>The Great Mother, Empress Maria Theresa of Austria...</i>

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:37.810
<i>...while worrying about the future
of her daughter, Antoinette...</i>

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:40.730
<i>... died at the age of 63.</i>

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:50.110
Please write a letter of condolence to your brother, Emperor Joseph in Austria.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.620
Count Mercy...

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.070
It's strange...

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.410
I can't see my writing clearly...

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.780
Mercy...

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.380
The river you could see
from Schönbrunn Palace...

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.940
What was its name...?

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.910
I can't seem to remember...

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:11.680
Mother... Mother...!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:18.260
Four years have already passed since
I showed this necklace to Her Majesty.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.800
Since then, I have traveled all over Europe...

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.810
...and even as far as Russia,
but still have no buyer.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.730
I, Boehmer, have pride as a jeweler.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:31.140
No matter what it takes, I wish to see Queen Marie
Antoinette of France purchase this piece.

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:33.340
Her elegance... Her beauty...

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:37.320
There is no one else better suited
than her to wear this necklace.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:44.250
However, now that she's withdrawn to the villa,
people like myself can't even speak to her.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:53.500
Therefore, since I hear you are very close with
the Queen, I've come to ask for your help.

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:58.130
May I ask you to urge Her Majesty
to make this purchase?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.030
I understand, Monsieur Boehmer.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:04.350
I'll see it to it.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:08.990
If you would do that, my visit
here was all the more worth it!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.880
Please come again in a week.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:16.480
I'll visit Trianon and convey your
wish to Her Majesty tomorrow.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:16.950
Yes, please do so.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.020
Hey, Jeanne.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.990
What are you cooking up this time?

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:27.200
You've never even spoken to the Queen,
let alone have access to Trianon.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.900
You should be drinking, too.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:33.170
Cheers to 1,600,000 livres!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.240
What is it, Jeanne?

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:44.550
You wanted to secretly meet in a place like this?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.210
What is it?

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.220
Some good news?

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.820
Of course, it is.

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:53.110
Have I ever brought you any bad news before?

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:54.510
Here.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.110
Come this way.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:11:59.660
What?

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.850
A necklace Her Majesty greatly desires?

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:03.450
Shh!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:06.270
You're speaking too loudly, Cardinal Rohan.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:10.370
Her Majesty has asked me
to keep it a strict secret,

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.960
especially from His Majesty.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:17.380
The reason is, His Majesty is strongly opposed to it, due to its exorbitant price.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.310
But Her Majesty has made up her mind.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:23.440
She will pay the 1,600,000 livres in installments.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:27.630
As expected of a person of
royal birth. How decisive.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.790
However, a problem has risen.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:33.490
In order to pay in installments,
a guarantor is required.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:36.930
It needs to be someone of respectable character,
who possesses rank and wealth.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.950
Someone trustworthy that
knows how to keep a secret.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:43.500
Her Majesty has said her guarantor would
be no one other than Cardinal Rohan.

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.010
R-Really?!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:49.010
There are plenty of people who
would be her guarantor and yet...

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:52.250
Th-This is such an unimaginable honor!

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:55.500
I'll do it! I'll do it, Jeanne!

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.210
I'll gladly be her guarantor!

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.190
<i>Marie...</i>

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.650
<i>Antoinette...</i>

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:25.040
<i>de... France...</i>

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:35.120
''I agree to pay the price of 1,600,000 livres, in 400,000
livres installments every 6 months for 2 years.''

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.110
Signed, ''Marie Antoinette de France.''

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:40.800
Perfect. Well then, Cardinal Rohan,
if you would please sign it.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:41.930
Yes, yes.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:45.680
Guarantor Louis de Rohan... Will that do?

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.310
Yes, indeed. This is perfect.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.260
The contract is sealed.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:53.210
Well then, Lady Jeanne, please make sure
the necklace is delivered to Her Majesty.

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:55.380
I most certainly will.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:58.580
Please remind Her Majesty
about the first payment.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.650
Yes, of course.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:00.720
Please excuse me then.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.010
Thank you for coming.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:03.780
Thank you.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.220
Cardinal Rohan.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.570
I should head over to Trianon now.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.890
Right, right.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:13.530
In that case, visit my manor tonight
and tell me what happened.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:16.100
Tell me how delighted Her Majesty was!

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.190
Yes, yes.

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:35.280
Come, Nicolas, head to England
immediately and sell off the diamonds!

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:37.020
Sell them in pieces, so they
can't track it back to us!

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.520
Rétaux, you flee to Switzerland.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.980
If they discover the signature
is forged, we'll be executed.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.190
Jeanne, what about you?

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:46.930
I'll stay in Paris for a while.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.240
If all three of us disappear, it will
immediately raise people's suspicions.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:58.750
What do you mean the Queen isn't in the palace?!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.780
Please stop raising your voice.

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.210
You are in the Palace of Versailles.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.610
What's wrong with raising my voice?!

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:08.720
A palace without a Queen is no
longer a palace to us, nobles!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:09.920
Please stop.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:13.010
If you continue like this, we'll be forced
to remove you from the palace.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.970
I'd like to see you try! Throw me out, if you dare!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.940
It took me 2 weeks to get here from Loire!

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.360
I need the royal household...

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:23.100
...to mediate a dispute with the
neighboring Lord as soon as possible!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.870
They say the Queen is busy with
boat rides and recitals at her villa!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.290
Yet, she won't have audiences with us?!

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:29.830
How much of a mockery does
she intend to make of us?!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:33.910
As I mentioned before, the Minister of the
Interior will meet with you on this matter.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.740
Forget the Minister!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.580
I want to speak to the Queen directly!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.780
I am the Regiment Commander
of the Royal Guards,

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:41.320
Colonel Oscar François de Jarjayes.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.420
So what?!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.380
I am asking you to leave for today.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.020
Let me go! I can walk myself out!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:49.890
Off of me!

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:51.800
Release him.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.100
Move! Out of my way!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.730
Colonel, if you're a noble,
you should know this, as well.

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:00.940
The nobility can't exist without the royal family,
nor can the royal family exist without the nobility!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.060
If the royal household continues to do
as it pleases, I no longer care anymore!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.570
I'll never come to Versailles again!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:06.570
Never!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:08.880
Good work, everyone.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.810
Return to your post.

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:10.500
Yes!

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:20.040
<i>Slowly but surely, the course of history
was beginning to change.</i>

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.610
<i>Not only among the commoners,
but even among the nobility,</i>

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.540
<i>the people were beginning to harbor
discontent towards the royal household.</i>

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:34.470
England has finally acknowledged
America's independence.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.350
The Expeditionary Forces are beginning
to return to Paris one after another.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.190
I thought I'd let you know...

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.870
Well...

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.410
Good night, Oscar.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.240
André.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:00.740
I'll go to Trianon and offer my
opinion to Her Majesty tomorrow.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.750
I'll urge her to resume maybe half of the number
of audiences she used to do before.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:08.210
At this rate, the rift between the nobility and
the royal household will grow even larger.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.120
Good night.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.560
My, Oscar!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:19.460
What a welcome visit.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.770
Why don't you visit me more often?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.850
I would see you every day, if you'd only visit.

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:27.000
Yes, thank you.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.490
I really mean it, Oscar.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.540
Oh, Marie Thérèse!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.340
Now, now...

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.370
Oh, right. Oscar, is there something
you wished to speak of?

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:43.150
Ah, no, it's been a while since I've visited,

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:45.330
so I've come to see if Your Majesty was well.

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.890
In that case, please stay as long as you'd like.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:50.760
Formalities aren't necessary here at Trianon.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.230
Please make yourself at home.

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:54.530
Yes, thank you, Your Majesty.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:57.940
Oscar...

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:58.970
Yes?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.340
I hear the Expeditionary Forces are returning.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:02.890
Yes.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.850
I wonder if he'll come see
me again when he returns...

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.020
4 years have passed since he left.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.540
Perhaps the passing of time has helped...

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:17.050
I can think of him calmly now.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:26.900
Since becoming a mother, Her Majesty
has grown even more beautiful.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:31.330
Most likely, this is the happiest
she's ever been.

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:33.880
I'll give her a little more time{,
before saying anything}...

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:41.390
Pardon me, Monsieur Rider.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.670
Sorry to trouble you.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.820
Could you tell me where Chevreuse is?

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:49.310
I hear it's near Versailles...?

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:54.790
I have to deliver my comrades'
keepsake to his family.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:00.530
Were you a member of the
Expeditionary Force to America?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.470
Yes.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.830
Don't worry.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.570
Chevreuse is nearby.

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:05.290
We'll take you there.

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:14.210
André, let's drink tonight!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.340
Take me to Paris!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:20.260
It's good to get drunk once in a while.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:33.300
There's no need to worry, Oscar.

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.650
He'll definitely come back alive. Fersen, I mean...

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.140
I looked it up.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.410
In the very least,
he's not listed as a casualty.

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.540
What are you saying?

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:44.120
Where is this coming from... so suddenly...?

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:55.550
Hey, you there, Young Lad.

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.630
You sure know how to take it down, don't you?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.620
What do you say? Another drink?

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:01.590
No thanks.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:04.590
What? My beer isn't good enough for you?

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.130
Now, now, Monsieur.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.970
I'll have it instead.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.560
I wasn't talking to you!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.840
But what do you know...

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:14.510
Just looking at you, I'm stunned.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:17.940
Even Zeus would drool over
such a beautiful soldier.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.970
Come on, drink up, Pretty Fellow.

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:21.990
Don't, Oscar!

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:30.870
Ow...

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.220
To Hell with your ''Beautiful Soldier!''

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:36.880
Lay one finger on me again and
you'll leave this bar unrecognizable!

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:40.300
Oh, you're feeling quite on edge tonight.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:42.760
Wouldn't you say so,
Beautiful Officer of the Royal Guards?

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.470
You're...!

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.390
Robespierre!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:48.570
Indeed, I am.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.640
It seems fate has crossed our paths once again.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.680
The last time was in Arras.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.100
That aside, I'm a lawyer in Paris now.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.240
Serving the people.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.730
Serving the people?

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:01.650
An officer of the Royal Guards?!

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.110
That means he's a noble.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.530
What's a refined noble doing in our bar?

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.120
He's an eyesore.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.530
Kick him out!

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:12.830
He's the Queen's dog!

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:22.940
Bernard.

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:26.300
If you want to become a true
journalist, watch closely.

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:30.610
Watch how the mere uttering of the word ''noble,''
causes the people to explode in rage.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:46.360
Oscar, consider yourself lucky they
didn't find out you're a woman.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.270
<i>But you know what, Oscar... I can tell.</i>

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:55.200
<i>No matter what outfit you wear,
you're unmistakably a woman to me.</i>

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:01.580
Your Majesty, you have a letter
from Boehmer, the jeweler.

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:03.010
Boehmer, the jeweler?

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:08.470
''Please make your first payment in
accordance with the received contract.''

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.590
First payment?

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:11.460
Contract?

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:12.950
I wonder what he's talking about?

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:14.600
This is ridiculous.

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:19.430
That jeweler must have lost his mind from
not being able to sell that necklace.

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:21.600
I'm sure. The poor man.

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:22.830
Um, the letter...?

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.610
There's no reason to keep it.

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:26.140
Yes.

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:31.280
<i>The so-called "Affair of the Diamond
Necklace" was soon about to unfold...</i>

00:22:29.370 --> 00:22:32.830
To be continued

